ADDITIONAL TERMS — Gated Prediction Files

The pre-decoded prediction files (.npy) and Stable Diffusion v1.4 weights
hosted on HuggingFace under IshantSingh94/RetinaReplay are subject to
additional access terms:

  1. Access is granted for non-commercial research and educational use only.
  2. Redistribution of prediction files or weights is not permitted.
  3. Any publication using these files must cite the RetinaReplay paper.
  4. Access may be revoked for misuse or violation of these terms.

Stable Diffusion v1.4 weights are subject to the CompVis model license:
  https://huggingface.co/CompVis/stable-diffusion-v1-4

The Natural Scenes Dataset is subject to its own terms of use:
  http://naturalscenesdataset.org

